HO SAKA NA AMBIYAA SE KAAM ASHGER KAR GAYA <br>
 GHAM KI DUNIYA KA QU LAASA DASTE SARWAR PA KIYA<br>
<br>
1.TASHNA KAAMI HAI MILI BAATIL KE LASHKAR KO YAHAIN <br>
 KAHGAYA SAB KUCH ISHROO MEIN FAQAT EK BE ZUBAN <br>
 JEETE JI ASHGAR TUMARA AAJ QATIT MARGAYA<br>
<br>
2.DUSMAN A NE HAQ NE DEKHA PYAAS MEIN SHAH UMAM <br>
 kHUSQ HOOTOUN PA TABASSAM THA CHALA TEER E SITAM <br>
 NOUKE NAIZA PAR BULAD ASHGER TUMARA SAR HOWA<br>
<br>
3.KIS TARHA SE DEKHI HOGI MAA YEH MANZAR FATIMA <br>
 CHAL RAHA THA HAIQ QE ASHGER PAR JO KHAJER FATIMA <br>
 TEER JIS PAR EK CHALA THA US PA KHAJER CHAL GAYA<br>
<br>
4.AALAM E ISLAM NE DEKHA NA AISA AAJ TAK <br>
 PHIR HOWA NA IS JAHAN MEIN AISA BACCHA AAJ TAK <br>
 MUSKURA KAR TEER KHANA BE ZUBAAN KA KAAM THA<br>
<br>
